WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.627
The in operator asks whether a value belongs to a collection.

00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:09.912
Allowed_statuses contains new, open, and closed.

00:00:09.912 --> 00:00:14.457
The loop checks each submitted status against that set.

00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:17.582
New and closed are valid.

00:00:17.582 --> 00:00:23.196
Pending and review are not in the allowed set, so they are flagged for review.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:29.692
This pattern is useful for validation because sets make membership rules clear and efficient.
